    },
    "largeheadline": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
      "jcr:created": "Thu Jul 15 2021 15:55:40 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "line1": "<span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,255,255);\">Wilhelmine learned that Goldenhar syndrome is a rare congenital condition that can affect the development of the <span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\">eye, ear, nose, throat, jaw or spine</span></span>.<sup>2</sup></span></span>",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Jul 15 2021 15:59:26 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/largeheadline",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(28,86,135,1)",
      "textIsRich": [
        "true",
        "true"
      ],
      "cq:responsive": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "default": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "offset": "2",
          "width": "8"
        },
        "phone": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "width": "12"
        }
      }
    },
    "text_2001972900": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
      "jcr:created": "Thu Jul 15 2021 17:14:25 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p>After doing a physical assessment and reviewing Philip’s CT scan, Dr. Lung diagnosed him with a <b>hemifacial microsomia</b>, a condition in which the tissues on one side of the face are underdeveloped. In Philip’s case, the right side of his jaw and throat was underdeveloped, causing challenges with his breathing and eating.</p>\n<p>Dr. Lung recalls the initial diagnosis. “With respect to Philip, I was asked to diagnose him based on his respiratory insufficiency (difficulty breathing). After working with the craniofacial team and discussing the diagnosis with the parents, we felt that the most improvement could occur with a <b>mandibular distraction</b>.”</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Jul 15 2021 17:15:34 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "cq:responsive": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "default": {
